864
00:54:25,010 --> 00:54:30,482
My teacher understood the anger that was driving these questions.

865
00:54:30,562 --> 00:54:32,770
He had seen how deeply I had

866
00:54:32,850 --> 00:54:39,410
resented my family, my former girlfriend, my old boss, and the relative who had given me temporary accommodation.

867
00:54:39,490 --> 00:54:44,050
I began interpreting everything I had learned through the lens of those grievances.

868
00:54:44,130 --> 00:54:47,300
The next several months were consumed by this obsession.

869
00:54:47,380 --> 00:54:53,460
I would think about the people who hurt me while traveling to work, while eating, and even while trying to sleep.

870
00:54:53,540 --> 00:55:00,100
I had convinced myself that the suffering I had experienced entitled me to make other people suffer as well.

871
00:55:00,180 --> 00:55:05,460
I will not pretend that I was acting out of some higher spiritual purpose.

872
00:55:05,540 --> 00:55:10,740
I was angry, bitter, and vindictive. I wanted revenge. The four people I could not forget.

873
00:55:10,820 --> 00:55:14,210
The first was my ex-girlfriend. I had spent months feeling humiliated by.

874
00:55:14,290 --> 00:55:16,214
by the way our relationship ended.

875
00:55:16,294 --> 00:55:21,190
I convinced myself that she had moved on too easily while I was struggling to put my life back together.

876
00:55:21,270 --> 00:55:22,195
Some months later,

877
00:55:22,275 --> 00:55:26,772
I learned that her marriage had fallen apart and that she was going through a divorce.

878
00:55:26,852 --> 00:55:30,990
It was all due to practices I performed which I would not like to discuss here.

879
00:55:31,070 --> 00:55:33,058
The second person was my father.

880
00:55:33,138 --> 00:55:38,486
Our fight over money had left me with a level of resentment I cannot properly describe.

881
00:55:38,566 --> 00:55:41,210
I wanted him to understand what it felt like.

882
00:55:41,290 --> 00:55:43,863
