883
00:55:43,943 --> 00:55:47,316
Later, I made him meet with an accident that broke his leg.

884
00:55:47,396 --> 00:55:51,492
When I heard the news, I felt a disturbing sense of satisfaction.

885
00:55:51,572 --> 00:55:53,344
The third was my former friend.

886
00:55:53,424 --> 00:55:58,658
I believed he had exploited my circumstances and treated me as though I was disposable.

887
00:55:58,738 --> 00:56:00,568
Sometime later, he lost his job.

888
00:56:00,648 --> 00:56:04,215
I saw it as another sign that the balance was being restored.

889
00:56:04,295 --> 00:56:09,180
The fourth was the relative who had given me a place to sleep but repeatedly

890
00:56:09,260 --> 00:56:11,188
made me feel small and unwelcome.

891
00:56:11,268 --> 00:56:15,788
He had demanded money from my father once I left as rent that I owed him.

892
00:56:15,868 --> 00:56:18,686
He fully knew my relationship with my father.

893
00:56:18,766 --> 00:56:19,963
I exacted my revenge.

894
00:56:20,043 --> 00:56:23,773
His business eventually failed and I secretly celebrated it.

895
00:56:23,853 --> 00:56:29,723
I understand that other people might interpret these events differently at the time.

896
00:56:29,803 --> 00:56:33,636
However, I saw them as confirmation that my efforts had worked.

897
00:56:33,716 --> 00:56:34,750
I felt justified.

898
00:56:34,830 --> 00:56:36,170
I believed these events.

899
00:56:36,250 --> 00:56:39,908
these people had hurt me first and I had simply returned the favor.

900
00:56:39,988 --> 00:56:44,180
I did not spend my time thinking about whether I was becoming a worse person.

901
00:56:44,260 --> 00:56:48,078
I was too too busy enjoying the feeling that I was no longer helpless.

902
00:56:48,158 --> 00:56:49,773
Why I eventually stopped.

903
00:56:49,853 --> 00:56:51,856
This continued for roughly over a year.

904
00:56:51,936 --> 00:56:55,380
For the first few months I met my teacher once or twice a week.

905
00:56:55,460 --> 00:56:58,851
For most of the remaining year I was meeting him almost daily,

906
00:56:58,931 --> 00:57:00,426
sometimes for several hours.

907
00:57:00,506 --> 00:57:03,350
My interest in the subject had become the center of my

908
00:57:03,430 --> 00:57:04,362
center of my life.

909
00:57:04,442 --> 00:57:05,953
Eventually I stopped.

910
00:57:06,033 --> 00:57:13,077
Not because I experienced some miraculous spiritual awakening and not because I suddenly realized that revenge was wrong.

911
00:57:13,157 --> 00:57:14,876
The truth is much less dramatic.

912
00:57:14,956 --> 00:57:16,722
I had exhausted my anger.

913
00:57:16,802 --> 00:57:24,689
I had spent a year thinking about people who had hurt me and I had reached a point where I no longer had the same desire to pursue them.

914
00:57:24,769 --> 00:57:27,548
My life also started improving in ordinary ways.

915
00:57:27,628 --> 00:57:29,670
I found a better job in my original field.

916
00:57:29,750 --> 00:57:34,710
moved into a decent apartment and began rebuilding some semblance of normality.

917
00:57:34,790 --> 00:57:39,750
I did not feel the need to continue. Today I am single, but I hope to settle down eventually.

918
00:57:39,940 --> 00:57:42,632
I have a stable job, a comfortable place to live,

919
00:57:42,712 --> 00:57:45,751
and I spend some of my free time doing community service,

920
00:57:45,831 --> 00:57:47,750
particularly helping elderly people.

921
00:57:47,830 --> 00:57:49,941
I am not claiming to be a saint.

922
00:57:50,021 --> 00:57:56,310
I still have flaws and I am not particularly proud of everything I did during the.

923
00:57:56,390 --> 00:57:57,337
during that year.

924
00:57:57,417 --> 00:58:03,325
However, I have moved forward and I have no intention of returning to those practices.

925
00:58:03,405 --> 00:58:05,742
I have now met someone like my old self.

926
00:58:05,822 --> 00:58:06,789
A few weeks ago,

927
00:58:06,869 --> 00:58:11,542
I met a young man who reminded me of myself from three and a half years ago.

